data: {"id": "2c43a88127dc48ec-thinking-parallel_evidence-843", "run_id": "2c43a88127dc48ec", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我注意到 baseline 中 execute_pod_promql 因参数格式问题失败，需要先修正。同时 baseline 中 logging/tracing 为空，需要先执行 kubectl 工具获取 Pod 真实状态和事件，这将是根因判断的核心证据。\n\n**首轮执行计划：**\n1. `kubectl_describe` - 获取 Pod 完整状态和事件\n2. `kubectl_events` - 获取与 workload 相关的事件\n3. `execute_pod_promql` - 修正参数后重新查询 waiting_reason\n4. `query_pod_topology` - 获取 Pod 拓扑关系\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789373591713, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

